    "detailed_description": "A long time ago, in the wilderness, Lucy, a being banished from another world, arrived on Earth to make it her home. The Earth was inhabited by the native fauna and the occasional visitor, which would not be a problem, until humans appeared and among them, the chosen one. Lucy, eager to dominate them all, used all the Machiavellian methods at her disposal, but humans are a tough nut to crack and will not let themselves be dominated so easily.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841610/extras/5d9b31b781edddc6b71bb9db9cf6355d.avif?t=1722420053\" width=616 height=228 /></span><br><br>Get ready for an exciting adventure in &quot;Ooga Booga: Troubles in Time&quot;! Choose your character and travel through different universes to defeat the forces of evil, the enemy is waiting to beat you up!<br><br>BEWARE, the enemy wants to trick you, don't fall into his traps. Prove that you are the chosen one!<br><br>Features<br><br>\u25a0 Jump over obstacles to pass the level.<br>\u25a0 Fight against a multitude of enemies in different scenarios.<br>\u25a0 Use the Power ups to increase your abilities.<br>\u25a0 Escape from the rolling stone down the hill.<br>\u25a0 Ride the pig and dodge the thugs.<br>\u25a0 Talk to the characters to defeat the final boss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841610/extras/313abf74905eb0a4c7951b815975524f.avif?t=1722420053\" width=616 height=153 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "A long time ago, in the wilderness, Lucy, a being banished from another world, arrived on Earth to make it her home. The Earth was inhabited by the native fauna and the occasional visitor, which would not be a problem, until humans appeared and among them, the chosen one. Lucy, eager to dominate them all, used all the Machiavellian methods at her disposal, but humans are a tough nut to crack and will not let themselves be dominated so easily.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841610/extras/5d9b31b781edddc6b71bb9db9cf6355d.avif?t=1722420053\" width=616 height=228 /></span><br><br>Get ready for an exciting adventure in &quot;Ooga Booga: Troubles in Time&quot;! Choose your character and travel through different universes to defeat the forces of evil, the enemy is waiting to beat you up!<br><br>BEWARE, the enemy wants to trick you, don't fall into his traps. Prove that you are the chosen one!<br><br>Features<br><br>\u25a0 Jump over obstacles to pass the level.<br>\u25a0 Fight against a multitude of enemies in different scenarios.<br>\u25a0 Use the Power ups to increase your abilities.<br>\u25a0 Escape from the rolling stone down the hill.<br>\u25a0 Ride the pig and dodge the thugs.<br>\u25a0 Talk to the characters to defeat the final boss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841610/extras/313abf74905eb0a4c7951b815975524f.avif?t=1722420053\" width=616 height=153 /></span>",
